---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/discovery-tier-counts-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/discovery-tier-counts-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Of 6,690 hits across 49 runs, 83 tiered likely"
  caption="Summed from the tier counts each run saved, late July to mid-November 2026. Counts only."
>
  Bar chart out of 6,690 username hits from 49 saved research runs. 6,218 landed in noise: a bare hit, or metadata that
  matched nothing. 389 landed in possible: the name in free text or the handle, or a location match. 83 landed in
  likely: first and last name in a structured name field.
</Chart>
